        "Title": "Toxic War #4",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLORADO",
        "PublicId": "109345255456",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Colorado_2/_scene_bull.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 90e997f4-67c6-486d-afb9-63c4424b1fd1).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening agent , today we are heading to colorado. Home to the private military group known as the militia. We&apos;ve had complaints about an internal fight between the militia cooks and the other militants, about the quality of the food not being very good. Though, the cooking group is doing the best it can with the limited resources. A contract has been issued to eliminate the trouble makers using some sort of lethal poison. \r\rGood Luck \r\rCreated by AKCSE",
